## What Are Ethical Hacking Services?

Ethical hacking is the process of testing computer systems, networks, websites, and applications to identify security weaknesses before malicious attackers can exploit them. Professional ethical hackers use authorized testing techniques to evaluate security controls and recommend practical improvements.

These assessments help organizations understand potential risks and strengthen their cybersecurity strategies.

